.gitignore file already configured for both backend and frontend

# Backend (.gitignore)
- node_modules/
- .env and environment files
- Log files
- OS files (.DS_Store)
- IDE files (.vscode, .idea)

# Frontend (.gitignore)
- node_modules/
- dist/ (build output)
- .env.local and environment files
- Log files
- OS files (.DS_Store)
- IDE files (.vscode, .idea)

To initialize git:
```bash
cd portfolio\ website
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: Full-stack portfolio website"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/yourusername/portfolio-website.git
git push -u origin main
```
